      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "These six documents follow one thread from 1960 to 1970: the Embassy reports corruption inside the Saigon government, raises it with the head of state, and by 1967 and 1970 is pressing it because the Congress and the press are doing so. They were chosen because each shows an American official acting on corruption or explaining why. What they do not show is aid cut for corruption; I did not find that."
